- `client/src/pages/OrphansPage/hooks/useOrphansPage.ts` - `assigning` and `deleting` are separate booleans that could be a single status enum
- `client/src/pages/CherrypickPage/hooks/useCherrypick.ts` - `deleteMainIds` and `deleteTangentIds` are always managed together, could be a single object
- `client/src/pages/SessionsPage/components/ActionsCell.tsx` - `renameVisible`, `deleteVisible`, `deleting` are three separate states that represent mutually exclusive UI states

**Zod usage:**
- Only used in `shared/sync/` for `.weaver.json` project config validation
- Server route handlers do manual `typeof` checks instead of Zod schemas for request body validation
- No Zod validation on webhook payloads, session data, or config API inputs

**`readdirSync` in shared code:**
- `shared/sync/sync.ts` uses `readdirSync` and `existsSync` - synchronous filesystem operations in shared code

